function experimentActions(e){const busy=experimentBusy(e),disabled=busy?'disabled title="请等待矿工配置调整完成或当前实验操作结束"':'';return `${lifecycleRequests.has(e.id)?'<p class="node-recovery-hint" role="status">操作请求正在处理；停止操作会等待当前维护安全结束（最长 90 秒），请勿重复提交。</p>':''}<div class="row-actions">${canFreshDeploy(e)?`<button class="action" onclick="experiment('${e.id}','deploy')" ${disabled}>部署新实验</button>`:''}${canResume(e)?`<button class="action" onclick="experiment('${e.id}','resume')" ${disabled}>按原目录恢复</button>`:''}${canStopExperiment(e)?`<button class="action secondary" onclick="experiment('${e.id}','stop')" ${e.miningStatus==='updating'||minerRequests.has(e.id)?'disabled title="请等待矿工配置调整完成"':disabled}>${e.status==='stop-failed'?'重新检查并停止':'停止实验'}</button>`:''}<a class="action secondary" href="/api/experiments/${e.id}/report">导出报告</a>${experimentActive(e)||busy?'':`<button class="action danger" onclick="deleteExperiment('${e.id}')">删除</button>`}</div>${['stopped','failed','interrupted','stop-failed'].includes(e.status)&&!canResume(e)&&!canFreshDeploy(e)?'<p class="node-recovery-hint">缺少原节点清单或运行包 SHA，无法安全恢复；请先核验停止结果，必要时新建实验。</p>':''}`}
function experimentNodeCount(e){return e.nodes?.length||(e.placements||[]).reduce((sum,p)=>sum+Number(p.count||0),0)}
function configuredMinerCount(e){return Number(e.minerCount)>0?Number(e.minerCount):1}
function nodeIsMiner(e,n){return typeof n.isMiner==='boolean'?n.isMiner:Number(n.index)===1}
function miningStats(e){const nodes=e.nodes||[];return {target:configuredMinerCount(e),active:nodes.filter(n=>n.status==='running'&&n.mining===true).length,unknown:nodes.filter(n=>nodeIsMiner(e,n)&&(n.status!=='running'||typeof n.mining!=='boolean')).length}}
function miningNeedsReapply(e){return e.status==='running'&&(e.nodes||[]).some(n=>n.status==='running'&&typeof n.mining==='boolean'?n.mining!==nodeIsMiner(e,n):nodeIsMiner(e,n))}
function nodeMiningLabel(e,n){const miner=nodeIsMiner(e,n),available=n.status==='running',label=!available?'挖矿状态未知':n.mining===true?'正在挖矿':n.mining===false?'未挖矿':'待采集挖矿状态',kind=available&&n.mining===true?'working':available&&miner&&n.mining===false?'warning':'';return `<span class="node-mining-role ${kind}" title="${miner?'配置为矿工':'配置为普通节点'}；实际挖矿状态由节点 eth.mining 采集，节点不可达时不计入在线矿工">${miner?'矿工':'普通节点'} · ${label}</span>`}
function miningHealth(e){const s=miningStats(e);if(e.status!=='running')return `<span>矿工配置 ${s.target} 个</span>`;return `<span class="${s.active===s.target&&!s.unknown&&!miningNeedsReapply(e)?'':'miner-health-warning'}">矿工配置 ${s.target} · 在线挖矿 ${s.active}${s.unknown?` · ${s.unknown} 个配置矿工状态未知`:''}</span>`}
